OL,3,GNEWSACobblers takeover 'like a
OL,4,AHollywood movie', say fans
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans of Northampton Town are hopeful
OL,7,Fthat the club's new ownership will mean
OL,8,Fa change of fortune for the team.
OL,10,FThe Cobblers sit 22nd in League Two
OL,11,Fafter seven games, following relegation
OL,12,Ffrom League One last season.
OL,14,FSome of the new owners, including
OL,15,Fformer AC Milan and Brazil player
OL,16,FAlexandre Pato, were at the 1-0 win
OL,17,Fover Newport County last month, but
OL,18,Fthat was the first victory since
OL,19,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
